# Scheme name: Lumina Quartz Dark Contrast
# Scheme system: base24
# Scheme author: Razik Ikhlef (https://github.com/RazikSF)
# Template author: https://github.com/tinted-theming/tinted-kermit-terminal

# Foreground color
